{"channelId":"UC7MTl9R9i4W3K7y-FRLXbwg","row":["Safe Haven Equine Rescue",19,"Safe Haven Equine Rescue and Retirement Home, Inc. is a volunteer based, non-profit organization accredited by the Global Federation of Animal Sanctuaries that is dedicated to the welfare of horses.  Our goal is to rescue abused, neglected, or distressed horses, bring these rescued horses back to optimal health and to find them loving homes.  In some cases, due to age or disability, a horse will not be able to be adopted. For these horses, Safe Haven Equine Rescue and Retirement Home, Inc. will provide a home where they can peacefully live out the rest of their life with love and dignity.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7MTl9R9i4W3K7y-FRLXbwg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7MTl9R9i4W3K7y-FRLXbwg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:31.897Z","channelId":"UC7MTl9R9i4W3K7y-FRLXbwg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"928dbd8276573656b42f4720a875644e981991efce88c4503592d9b7ab15cffd","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"5a2dbfab3df20bd788d7df47869bd302d9e32238d9a2733071a1d28b05a91997"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7MTl9R9i4W3K7y-FRLXbwg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:31.897Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7MTl9R9i4W3K7y-FRLXbwg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":19,"raw":"19 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7MTl9R9i4W3K7y-FRLXbwg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:31.897Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[{"url":"https://www.safehavenequinerescue.com/contact-us","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:42:47.303Z"}],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"organization_self_report","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7MTl9R9i4W3K7y-FRLXb